==Trivia==
*Heaven's Oasis's Japanese name, Tengoku ni Ichiban Chikai Mizunomi-ba (天国に一番近い水飲み場, "The Drinking Fountain Closest to Heaven"), may be a reference to ''[[wikipedia:ja:天国にいちばん近い島|Tengoku ni Ichiban Chikai Shima]]'' (天国に一番近い島, "''The Island Closest to Heaven''"), a travel diary by Katsura Morimura that was later adapted into a television drama and [[wikipedia:The Island Closest to Heaven|movie]].

